cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this package, cite MuJoCo.
title: MuJoCo prebuilt for riscv64-linux-gnu
abstract: >-
  MuJoCo 3.14.0 cross-compiled to riscv64-linux-gnu as static archives, so a
  RISC-V sandbox guest can link against it without a cross-toolchain or a
  container. Unmodified sources; only the build configuration differs.
type: software
authors:
  - name: DeepMind Technologies Limited
    website: https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco
url: https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco
license: Apache-2.0
version: 3.14.0
